text Naranja_Norte_G30_M00_Text_0819E4E6 {
    "Nos ayudaste muchìsimo,  \nayudando a mi hermano.\p¿Cómo podrìa ayudarte?\p¡Ya sé!\pTen este saco y recoge el ampo,\nlos copos de nieve de las islas del norte.\pCon ampo haremos cristal."
}

text Naranja_Norte_G30_M00_Text_0819E59B {
    "La blancura,\nel ampo\lquedará recogida en el saco.\py asì podré fabricarte\ndeslumbrantes regalos\p…deslumbrantes como el ampo.\pSolo camina bajo la nieve del norte\ny cuando tengas bastante… ¡Ven!"
}

text Naranja_Norte_G30_M00_Text_0819E65B {
    "Have you collected ashes, huff-puff?\nLet me see, huff-puff."
}

text Naranja_Norte_G30_M00_Text_0819E697 {
    "Hmmm...\nThere’s not enough ash here, huff-puff.\lI can’t make glass with this, huff-puff.\pLet’s see... {STR_VAR_1} is the number of steps\nyou’ll need to walk for me to make you\la BLUE FLUTE, huff-puff."
}

text Naranja_Norte_G30_M00_Text_0819E757 {
    "Oh!\nYou’ve got a lot of ashes, huff-puff!\pI’ll make you a glass item, huff-puff!\nWhich one would you like, huff-puff?"
}

text Naranja_Norte_G30_M00_Text_0819E7CD {
    "A {STR_VAR_1}, huff-puff?\nIs that the one for you, huff-puff?"
}

text Naranja_Norte_G30_M00_Text_0819E802 {
    "Which one would you like, huff-puff?"
}

text Naranja_Norte_G30_M00_Text_0819E827 {
    "A {STR_VAR_1} it is, then, huff-puff!\pOkay! I’ll make it for you, huff-puff.\nJust wait a little while, huff-puff."
}

text Naranja_Norte_G30_M00_Text_0819E890 {
    "A {STR_VAR_1}, huff-puff?\pThere’s not enough ash here to make\nthat, though, huff-puff.\pLet’s see... {STR_VAR_2} is the number of steps\nyou’ll need to walk through volcanic ash\lfor me to make that item, huff-puff.\pWhich item would you rather have me\nmake instead, huff-puff?"
}

text Naranja_Norte_G30_M00_Text_0819E990 {
    "You’ve collected all that ash, but you\ndon’t want anything, huff-puff?"
}

text Naranja_Norte_G30_M00_Text_0819E9D7 {
    "Ah, I’ve finished your {STR_VAR_1}.\nTake it, huff-puff."
}

text Naranja_Norte_G30_M00_Text_0819EA06 {
    "Oh?\nYou’ve no room in your BAG, huff-puff.\pI’ll hold on to it, so come back later,\nhuff-puff."
}

text Naranja_Norte_G30_M00_Text_0819EA64 {
    "Oh?\nYou’ve no room in your PC, huff-puff?\pI’ll hold on to it, so come back later,\nhuff-puff."
}

text Naranja_Norte_G30_M00_Text_0819EAC1 {
    "Hah? You haven’t got your AMPO SACO\nwith you, huff-puff.\pYou have to keep it with you to collect\nvolcanic ash, huff-puff."
}

text Naranja_Norte_G30_M00_Text_0819EB3B {
    "It’s fun to blow a glass flute while my\nboss is talking.\pHuff-huff! Puff-puff!"
}
